flowchart LR
    F[Feature name] --> Q{Why does task policy change?}

    Q -->|resource boundary| Cost
    Q -->|semantic difference| Compatibility
    Q -->|temporal dependence| Continuity
    Q -->|past evidence changes future policy| Cognition
    Q -->|missing / stale / unattributable evidence| Epistemic[Epistemic Access]
    Q -->|truth / acceptance / postcondition| Validity
    Q -->|principal / delegation / permission| Authority
    Q -->|only computation changes| Infrastructure

    N[No causal residual] --> Reject[Mechanism, outcome, or pattern<br/>not a fundamental category]
